The '''Braton Prime''' is the [[Prime]] variant of the {{Weapon|Braton}}, featuring higher damage, [[critical chance]], [[critical multiplier]], [[status chance]], [[fire rate]], magazine size, and ammo reserves, at the cost of [[reload speed]].

==Characteristics==
* This weapon deals primarily {{D|Slash}} damage.

